    "body": "fix on issue/1017-face-turn-refusal-spot · PR #1023 (stacked on #993) · pinned by a_refusal_from_the_turned_frame_names_its_spot_where_the_part_is, with_no_turn_the_spot_is_unchanged, a_ghost_turns_back_with_the_spot_and_a_plain_refusal_passes · merges when reviewed. Note: no end-to-end test is possible today (a spot refusal cannot arise under a turn yet: an open chain drops base holes and surviving holes are refused spotless by face_band_sane first); see docs/decisions/1017-face-turn-refusal-spot.md.",
